    const id=ps.ideal,tip=ok?(id&&Math.abs(ps.lead-id.L)<1.2?`Perfect weight: you led him ${fmt(ps.lead,1)} m, the ideal was ${fmt(id.L,1)} m.`:`Complete! ${ps.broke?`That pass cut out ${ps.broke} defender${ps.broke>1?'s':''}.`:''}`):o==='intercepted'?`The lane was too tight. ${ps.lane?`The ball passed ${fmt(ps.lane.dd,2)} m from ${ps.lane.d.name}, and he could slide ${fmt(ps.lane.mv,2)} m in time.`:''} Pass faster, pick the other runner, or loft it over him.`:o==='short'?`It died on the grass: rolling friction keeps slowing a ground pass. Add power on the v_pass dial.`:o==='heavy'?`Too much power: ${fmt(vArr,1)} m/s bounced off his foot. The best passes arrive at 8 to 14 m/s.`:o==='closed'?'The presser got to you. Pick a pass a bit sooner.':`Aim where he will be: lead = v_runner × t_ball${id?` ≈ ${fmt(id.L,1)} m`:''}.`;
